ke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"7\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg></button></div></nav></header><main class=\"membership-section\"><div class=\"section-inner\"><div class=\"section-tag\">Membership</div><h2 class=\"section-h2\">Join a <em>living piece</em><br/>of London history</h2><p class=\"section-lead\">We may be a small private club, but we&#x27;re a friendly, sociable one with a wonderfully colourful history. Over the years, our green has welcomed generations of Barnes residents, including musicians, artists and writers.</p><p class=\"section-lead\">Whether you&#x27;re an experienced player or completely new to bowls, we encourage you to come down, meet us and give it a go.</p><div style=\"margin-top:3rem;display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch\"><div class=\"membership-card\" style=\"flex:1 1 280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div class=\"membership-card-tag\">Member</div><div class=\"membership-card-name\">Membership Fee</div><div class=\"membership-price\">£215</div><div class=\"membership-price-note\">per season</div><ul class=\"membership-features\" style=\"flex:1\"><li>Unlimited green access, Apr–Oct</li><li>All club competitions</li><li>Equipment provided for beginners</li><li>Coaching from experienced members</li><li>Club newsletter &amp; social events</li><li>Off-Season social events</li></ul><div class=\"joining-fee-box\"><div class=\"joining-fee-label\">One-Time Joining Fee</div><div class=\"joining-fee-amount\">£100</div><div class=\"joining-fee-note\">Payable once on first joining the club</div></div><a class=\"pay-btn-gold\" href=\"/apply\">Apply for Membership →</a></div><div class=\"membership-card\" style=\"flex:1 1 280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div class=\"membership-card-tag\">Joining Fee</div><div class=\"membership-card-name\">Joining the Club</div><div class=\"membership-price\">£100</div><div class=\"membership-price-note\">one-time on joining</div><p style=\"font-family:&#x27;Libre Baskerville&#x27;, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(245,240,232,.75);margin:0;flex:1\">The one-time joining fee offers lifetime membership to our private club. Applicants are proposed and seconded by two active voting members and join a waitlist; membership and fees are non-transferable.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:2rem\"><div class=\"membership-card\"><div class=\"membership-card-tag\">No Experience Needed</div><div class=\"membership-card-name\">Wednesday Club Nights</div><div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-family:&#x27;Libre Baskerville&#x27;, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(245,240,232,.75);margin:0 0 1.25rem\">Try your arm at one of our Wednesday evening roll-ups — just turn up! No experience is needed and all equipment is provided on the day.</p><p style=\"font-family:&#x27;Libre Baskerville&#x27;, serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(245,240,232,.75);margin:0\">It&#x27;s a relaxed, friendly evening — a great way to see if bowls is for you before committing to full membership.</p></div><div style=\"margin-top:2.5rem\"><a class=\"pay-btn-gold\" href=\"/roll-ups\">Find Out More →</a></div></div></div></div></main><footer style=\"background:var(--green-deep)\"><div class=\"footer-main-grid\" style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:4rem 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"justify-self:start\"><a class=\"nav-brand\" style=\"margin-left:-2px;top:0\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"nav-brand-name\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:44px\">BBC</span><span class=\"nav-brand-sub\">Est. <span class=\"nav-brand-sup\">c</span>1725</span></a></div><div><address style=\"font-family:&#x27;Optima&#x27;, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;margin:0;font-style:normal;margin-b